{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors of Thalyrion is a 2D pixelart action game in which you can fight short and fun battles against your friends. As a classic couch game, you play on the same PC as your friend and you share the same game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose a hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting the game, you decide on a hero. You can choose between different archetypes and weapons. Do you prefer the sword or the bow? Every character has a weapon for close combat and one for distance fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967820/extras/87e164f33c36f97d74a4c8bfff8f5377.avif?t=1771445872\" width=250 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose a game mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP:</strong> In PvP mode, your teammate is your opponent. Try to achieve the round objectives and score more points than your opponent. Each arena is set up differently and a round is limited in time. With targeted attacks, you can prevent your opponent from collecting points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> In the co-op campaign, you play together with your teammate. Complete the round objectives together to reach the next level. A campaign consists of several levels, which are completed with a boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo:</strong> You can also play through the campaigns alone. But be aware that it won\u2019t be easy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2967820?t=1771445872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771445872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2