\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> In the co-op campaign, you play together with your teammate. Complete the round objectives together to reach the next level. A campaign consists of several levels, which are completed with a boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo:</strong> You can also play through the campaigns alone. But be aware that it won\u2019t be easy.</p>","developers":["Castle Village Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967820/header.jpg?t=1771445872","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(C) 2024 Castle Village Games GmbH","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2967820/977006132/d03e73e80f9c83cf47e52c3f2c8cb9166a6e0c7e/1759770550/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759771442","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2967820/977006132/d03e73e80f9c83cf47e52c3f2c8cb9166a6e0c7e/1759770550/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759771442","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2967820/977006132/d03e73e80f9c83cf47e52c3f2c8cb9166a6e0c7e/1759770550/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759771442","id":257132114,"name":"Main","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132114/b4d63e358525d48a520fa17fafb8ca90b5d836c5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759771442"}],"name":"Warriors of Thalyrion","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},